<body>
    <h1>ProxyIQ Home</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"21ae83e10ee1" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-=F0=9F=8E=AFOvervie=
w">=F0=9F=8E=AF Overview</h1>
<p local-id=3D"26ec33da26d9">ProxyIQ is a comprehensive healthcare supply c=
hain management platform built with modern cloud-native technologies. It fa=
cilitates order management, billing, inventory tracking, and compliance rep=
orting across multiple organizational entities (Hospitals/Facilities, Vendo=
rs, Providers, and Super Vendors). The application emphasizes HIPAA complia=
nce, multi-tenant architecture, and role-based access control.</p>
<p local-id=3D"643b449ba479">"Think <strong>Amazon for medical equipment</s=
trong> =E2=80=94 but specifically designed for hospitals. ProxyIQ eliminate=
s phone calls, emails, and paperwork by digitizing the entire workflow from=
 order creation to payment."</p>
<p local-id=3D"185b37e74d7d"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"796535dd032d" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-=E2=9D=8CTheProblemWeSolve"=
>=E2=9D=8C The Problem We Solve</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"87a57b157a82" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-BeforeProxyIQ(TraditionalPr=
ocess):">Before ProxyIQ (Traditional Process):</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bc920e27a56c"><strong>For Hospitals:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"252bef4d-5728-4293-bf12-8b3fa172f857">
<li local-id=3D"abbb2ed2-171d-4396-b154-65e685ae5f43">
<p local-id=3D"e81fe0c6e7d4">=F0=9F=93=9E Call vendors on the phone to orde=
r equipment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4eb5a47e-7b8b-4c8b-8d06-f0d0147e9d73">
<p local-id=3D"89b64151ebe1">=F0=9F=93=A7 Send emails back and forth to con=
firm availability</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d33e194c-0f45-4357-94b6-16e8b68303dd">
<p local-id=3D"7012b8dee395">=F0=9F=93=9D Fill out paper forms or Excel spr=
eadsheets</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9bcfb01f-3794-4e4c-a8d0-4a12e2fb6a40">
<p local-id=3D"51188d4f16fa">=E2=9D=93 No visibility into order status ("Wh=
ere's my wheelchair?")</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e081abe-f29d-48e6-a6f7-451be7becb1e">
<p local-id=3D"e7e4875e7535">=F0=9F=92=B0 Invoices arrive weeks later with =
errors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b4a3948-d9d2-4de2-ac8f-484720348004">
<p local-id=3D"5d06d68e780c">=F0=9F=93=8B No audit trail for compliance</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"295f1fe37dd8"><strong>For Vendors:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"209e8353-2bf5-42cd-8292-acf10bbd0dd9">
<li local-id=3D"c9d11087-e322-45a9-b867-5eebc4672985">
<p local-id=3D"7a8f007ac341">=F0=9F=93=9E Missed calls =3D missed orders</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f943669-d344-44ae-80e4-7ba367afe628">
<p local-id=3D"6dec61dacc97">=F0=9F=93=A7 Lost emails =3D delayed fulfillme=
nt</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b6d2e7e7-4d83-4551-bf88-eaf9cd4d5c27">
<p local-id=3D"5dd055f01526">=F0=9F=93=9D Manual invoice creation (error-pr=
one)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"85339131-fdf6-44d8-9a29-efd6af6ba7ed">
<p local-id=3D"83a2b59d7e3b">=E2=9D=93 No confirmation when hospital receiv=
es delivery</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8317268c-fc26-4341-8704-0b0ab308c454">
<p local-id=3D"7231f7734bf4">=F0=9F=92=B8 Payment delays due to invoice dis=
putes</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a4e86f73e508"><strong>Result:</strong> Slow, frustrating, er=
ror-prone for everyone. Patients wait longer for critical equipment.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b53780fb55f5"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"20c7573c0308" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-=E2=9C=85OurSolution">=E2=
=9C=85 Our Solution</h2>
<p local-id=3D"09546593ac25">ProxyIQ is a <strong>single digital platform</=
strong> where hospitals, vendors, and healthcare networks collaborate in re=
al-time.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"db249ab51702" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-WhatProxyIQDoes:">What Prox=
yIQ Does:</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"52=
718d3d-615c-4d7e-a36e-a0e5b538641e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c33204f4-235f-4303-b658-ef5aa98481a0">
<th data-local-id=3D"f46857b1-f747-4bce-bd4d-31b58fe7fcbd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"86a0f53dbd0c">Traditional Way</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6ccf6c17-40e0-435f-99ef-5dd2668f8a0a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3c6e07929055">ProxyIQ Way</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"613de2aa-1fd4-4ba1-91a5-3ce1660bacf6">
<td data-local-id=3D"538fec5c-b0a8-4464-b7c7-c25fc55087aa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e25196523130">Phone call to vendor</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e4e85c38-9821-4ee9-a876-067a130373ea" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6745c18fce73">Click "Create Order" button</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7f4a50fa-d8f5-4817-8f89-e6ec313cdedc">
<td data-local-id=3D"51dc3bcc-ae92-4069-a150-9ca2aa8d5834" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"586cb7f1003e">Wait for vendor callback</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"56755775-3017-4808-a267-4d811606bae8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32a3948b9070">Vendor notified instantly</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c2a86c1a-0578-4d4f-9fe2-67bacadaaab1">
<td data-local-id=3D"ac2fc99d-7bed-431e-8c7d-89bd44631c1b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"031c57baf9aa">"Where's my order?" calls</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"900ca424-b672-40ce-8c61-d856b5de794b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1479365b5312">Real-time status tracking</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5c5cc0bf-7e99-4b9b-8f59-b7bd6be59fd4">
<td data-local-id=3D"4bbbfb45-22a5-40d7-bcb3-5abe9ef95784" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7bd822703113">Manual invoicing</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ead7743b-4750-4e93-a60b-40979854e5d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d84c8e860e6">Auto-generated invoices</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8d07d747-f9a9-4559-a85f-c4bf56cfa42e">
<td data-local-id=3D"8a6cef27-96e1-49c2-8a2d-de5014717d32" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"227f305ad2f6">3-5 days to process order</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2061cfc-6079-4776-815e-6e972524b699" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47041cb5d3df">Order confirmed in &lt;1 hour</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0a4a8dad-ab13-4a26-9ccc-c7a1ab897e82">
<td data-local-id=3D"fa64609b-29ee-4b54-95c9-2c9893e3801d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"11492a6ffa88">No audit trail</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4e83477-afb5-447d-a375-75b570dee7ca" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9e991f45509">Complete compliance logging</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"9b2e5fb84bce"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"ce942fc4e9a7" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-=F0=9F=91=A5WhoUsesProxyIQ?=
">=F0=9F=91=A5 Who Uses ProxyIQ?</h2>
<p local-id=3D"e5d1afe3af49">ProxyIQ serves <strong>5 types of users</stron=
g>:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"69d074ec5907" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-1.=F0=9F=8F=A5FacilityUsers=
">1. =F0=9F=8F=A5 Facility Users</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c22729f8befa"><strong>Who:</strong> Nurses, clinicians, supp=
ly chain staff at hospital branches/departments</p>
<p local-id=3D"6785c6838fcd"><strong>What they do:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"35fd7b6d-dcd3-40bc-ba34-75a05c53ea6e">
<li local-id=3D"67582ee5-0d99-4cd9-adfa-8aeff6b0fc87">
<p local-id=3D"f07730f0e1fd">Create orders for patients (wheelchairs, oxyge=
n tanks, hospital beds, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"748073c4-0232-43a7-9e0c-d08fd8e2921c">
<p local-id=3D"fa37eec043d6">Track order status in real-time</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e3465a1f-3739-4417-9119-5ed365b626be">
<p local-id=3D"85b3d67dc912">Chat with vendors about delivery details</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"720e2e5e-1995-4e28-b3e7-432c0e1c423f">
<p local-id=3D"10ce3a4a8bdf">Confirm receipt of equipment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"017023a6-cb54-4649-8519-0537c5d309b5">
<p local-id=3D"eade1b8feba3">Review and approve invoices</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"19fb73f39baa"><strong>Example:</strong> A nurse at Kaiser Pe=
rmanente - Downtown Branch needs a wheelchair for Room 305. Creates order i=
n ProxyIQ =E2=86=92 Vendor confirms delivery for tomorrow at 10 AM.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"207e7564-e6b6-4bf3-a0fd-a25f6b735aea">
<h3 local-id=3D"4f9e3098c714" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-2.=F0=9F=9A=9AVendorUsers">=
2. =F0=9F=9A=9A Vendor Users</h3>
<p local-id=3D"e3fdec9a21e9"><strong>Who:</strong> Medical equipment suppli=
ers (external companies like ABC Medical Supplies)</p>
<p local-id=3D"427bf6259232"><strong>What they do:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"96535611-79fd-4c92-a893-cd4dfa2c2998">
<li local-id=3D"be592775-79f2-4e7d-b1e4-cf496039e8f4">
<p local-id=3D"e94b7fe36917">Receive order notifications instantly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"79b83d3d-9bf9-49a1-b651-d1982d9c6275">
<p local-id=3D"f9143ea97743">Confirm or decline orders</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fbe1f95-6e6a-4936-bcc4-5c379231219c">
<p local-id=3D"bd7015c33506">Update delivery status (Ready to Ship =E2=86=
=92 Shipped =E2=86=92 Delivered)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bcc0f6a-3c64-4ccd-b9ae-14e3b5536eb2">
<p local-id=3D"c7eb34028616">Upload proof of delivery (signature photos)</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"e273074f-1fcb-42bf-9214-8c79a6fd2b28">
<p local-id=3D"5c23a42d3506">Generate invoices automatically</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2342e29f9e4f"><strong>Example:</strong> ABC Medical Supplies=
 receives wheelchair order at 9 AM, confirms delivery for next day, uploads=
 signature photo when delivered, system auto-generates invoice.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"5b4279b6-db82-46f8-84bb-285223e0da13">
<h3 local-id=3D"f6249be66f16" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-3.=F0=9F=8F=A2ProviderUsers=
">3. =F0=9F=8F=A2 Provider Users</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a1b9863863da"><strong>Who:</strong> Hospital network executi=
ves (e.g., Kaiser Permanente corporate, HCA Healthcare)</p>
<p local-id=3D"c706467d29a2"><strong>What they do:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d70bf440-615e-4995-893a-da0204d1ddc0">
<li local-id=3D"04d96c2b-83fd-4fc2-b7ff-19fe8cd5d683">
<p local-id=3D"86d7f92218cf">Monitor ALL orders across ALL facilities in th=
eir network</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8bf671df-3dc4-4b71-912b-d492ab72b573">
<p local-id=3D"f0d6269a44f6">View network-wide analytics (spending trends, =
vendor performance)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"654bf326-9e75-4704-9208-caf1dfec6696">
<p local-id=3D"27b182b28138">Manage contracts with vendors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"458e6e2d-eaa2-4d5c-b115-304b6db7bcab">
<p local-id=3D"871093c5a1c7">Oversee compliance across facilities</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cf8dc485c527"><strong>Key:</strong> Providers can <strong>VI=
EW and MONITOR</strong> but cannot <strong>CREATE or FULFILL</strong> order=
s. They are purely for oversight.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f186e8e7db60"><strong>Example:</strong> Kaiser Permanente co=
rporate can see all orders from Kaiser Downtown, Kaiser Uptown, Kaiser ICU,=
 etc., in one dashboard.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"0a955c4e-9f6d-4a51-86eb-6fcc99c9a8d1">
<h3 local-id=3D"be6f503d40dd" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-4.=F0=9F=93=A6SuperVendorUs=
ers">4. =F0=9F=93=A6 Super Vendor Users</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2f2cfdebc111"><strong>Who:</strong> Multi-vendor organizatio=
ns (umbrella companies managing multiple vendor entities)</p>
<p local-id=3D"a1024fa11613"><strong>What they do:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"31500c1d-6701-4ec5-a523-3d60f6cadc72">
<li local-id=3D"5584c36e-8678-4b61-8ec0-7ef47969e2f1">
<p local-id=3D"a8d48c17a687">Oversee multiple vendor companies under one or=
ganization</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1b519223-8802-400c-9b09-24c1707a215c">
<p local-id=3D"ad9a06728dee">Consolidated reporting across all vendors</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"cc0b436d-8967-48d7-b51e-64f770194f2e">
<p local-id=3D"444ba3f6b046">Manage group contracts and master pricing agre=
ements</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cb07c206-a847-4597-ba01-e6a49712970b">
<p local-id=3D"919a18dc8b0b">Monitor performance of all vendors in the netw=
ork</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9df2544faba7"><strong>Example:</strong> XYZ Medical Group ow=
ns ABC Medical Supplies, DEF Equipment, and GHI Healthcare. Super Vendor ro=
le lets them see all orders, invoices, and performance across all three ven=
dors.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3885eb2c50aa"><strong>Note:</strong> Less common role, but u=
seful for large distributors.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"8b79617c-8fbb-4d81-b2e7-1382584ad008">
<h3 local-id=3D"05cdd8700788" id=3D"ProxyIQHome-5.=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8FAdminUs=
ers">5. =E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F Admin Users</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4412a5ebc5ad"><strong>Who:</strong> Platform administrators =
(Nexkara staff or client admin users)</p>
<p local-id=3D"d40a118e0236"><strong>What they do:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"020627d7-4c5f-4971-99d9-84999fd5f68c">
<li local-id=3D"892239cf-3069-4d7c-826b-438fe4ef6692">
<p local-id=3D"83d0a2710f50">Create and manage users (facilities, vendors, =
providers)</p></li>
